title: ForestGeneralLines
---
<<declare $fgNumber = 0>>
<<set $fgNumber = random_range(0, 4)>>
<<if $fgNumber == 0>>
He's out there somewhere.
<<elseif $fgNumber == 1>>
Don’t give in to fear. He needs me.
<<elseif $fgNumber == 2>>
This fog… it’s not natural. It wants me to forget.
<<elseif $fgNumber == 3>>
Every step takes me closer… I have to believe that.
<<else>>
They won’t keep him from me. Not without a fight.
<<endif>>
===
